We process thousands of job applications daily at Eightfold. We need a Candidate Notification Service that keeps applicants informed about their application status.
Build a backend service that:

Allows recruiters to send status update notifications to candidates
Supports three notification channels — email, SMS, and in-app
If a notification fails, it should retry up to 3 times before marking it as failed
Recruiters can check the delivery status of any notification
At the end of each day, generate a summary report of total sent, failed, and pending notifications


Requirements: 
- Recruiter can send the notifications to the user. 
- Supported channel: email, SMS, in-app
- 3 retries -> before failed
- delivery status?
- dashboard: sent notif, failed, pending

